  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Chris Sawin",
      "content": "The promotional material for *God Skin* described it as steampunk Muay Thai, which it unfortunately is not. It’s more of a Muay Thai version of Leigh Whannell’s *Upgrade*, which is still potentially cool. Conceptually, *God Skin* is off-the-charts awesome. But its execution leaves so much to be desired. The film’s flaws can almost be completely forgiven when it comes to *God Skin*’s finale, as the twist is unbelievably ballsy and unexpected.\r\n\r\nhttps://bit.ly/GodSkin",
      "rating": 6,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-14T19:10:13Z"
    }
